          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I get photos back before the September 1 rush?",
            "answer": "That's exactly the case virtual staging handles well. Turnaround is 24 to 48 hours from upload, so a listing photographed on a Monday can go live mid-week — no waiting on a stager's schedule during the busiest weeks of the Boston calendar."
